# IndiaGrowthScreener scheduled jobs for cron (install with `crontab -e`). Times are in the
# computer's time zone; shown here for IST. NSE publishes the bhavcopy and delivery files
# in the evening, so the daily job runs after 20:30 IST on weekdays. Output is appended to
# logs/daily.log and logs/sources.log in the repository; settings come from its .env file.
# docs/DEPLOY.md has the systemd-timer alternative, which also catches up on runs missed
# while the computer was off.
#
# m  h  dom mon dow  command
30 20  *   *   1-5  $HOME/TradingHelper/scripts/igs-job.sh daily
#
# Re-verify every endpoint weekly so a format change is caught before it matters:
0  8   *   *   6    $HOME/TradingHelper/scripts/igs-job.sh sources verify
